          "kind": "note",
          "when": {
            "metric": "price-free",
            "is": 1
          },
          "body": "At a price of 0 there is nothing for the costs to be a share of, and every one sold loses what it cost to make, pack and send. Type the price it sells for."
        },
        {
          "kind": "note",
          "when": {
            "metric": "price-unjudged",
            "is": 1
          },
          "body": "The costs are not added up yet. They are added whenever a cost is typed, so type one of them again to see the verdict."
        },
        {
          "kind": "note",
          "when": {
            "metric": "price-room",
            "gte": 0
          },
          "body": "It passes: the costs are {{cost-share}} of the price."
        },
        {
          "kind": "note",
          "when": {
            "metric": "price-room",
            "lt": 0
          },
          "body": "Too thin: the costs are {{cost-share}} of the price. Raise the price or bring a cost down until they are at most two fifths of it."
